@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:FalsificationReceipt a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Falsification Receipt"; skos:definition "A receipt preserving a failed invariant, exact evidence, and the newly learned constraint or eliminated option." .